<p>The balls will collide. If there were no gravity, the balls would travel a straight line and meet between the cannons. When gravity is introduced, it imparts the same vertical acceleration to both balls, so they must still meet.</p>
<p>Somewhat similar: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkey_and_hunter">the monkey and the hunter.</a></p>
